            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release.

- Hold ⌘ and press E in Claude to move through the Effort menu, then release ⌘ to select.
- Skips Ultracode unless you remove it from the config file.
- Shows the current effort level in the menu bar.

Requires macOS 15 or later on Apple silicon. The first time you open CcEffortSwitch, macOS may refuse to open it; [First launch](https://github.com/GooZhenJie/cc-effort-switch#first-launch) explains what to do.
]]></description>
